  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "靴管"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作者：</span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>尤慧美</b></span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">烏色ê靴管糊黏塗</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">塗ê頂kuân貼野草</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tshiah查某一路tuè-tiâu-tiâu</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作穡ê鞋仔凊彩褪</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一跤徛直直　一跤睏笑笑</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī nî-tsînn跤歇涼</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">顧食ê草蜢仔m̄驚死</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">勻勻仔uì靴管頂爬--落-來</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">頭攑kuân-kuân leh tshàng鬚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">孤獨癖跤手mé-lia̍h</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">偷食ê時tsūn，si——</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">恬tsiuh-tsiuh！M̄-thang出聲</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">頂晡ê日頭燒熱</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">靴管頂ê黏塗必--開</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蜘蛛網ê痕跡</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Khà-khà--leh lak塗屎</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tshiah查某siânn厝角鳥仔</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ná食ná搖kha-tshng花跳tshiah-tshiah</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">門口埕ê靴管</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">行出行入無閒tshih-tshih</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sa̍h過燒水ê月桃葉</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">緊手拆開一葉一葉ài曝ta</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一枝竹tshuê仔hiàm bē走</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tia̍p翼股ê跟tuè</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Beh暗仔ê靴管</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tshiō黃昏ê光影</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Ànn腰khau一把tshiah查某</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hiânn一鈷青草茶燒燒仔ha</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">月桃葉koh曝--兩-日-仔</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">擔去賣　一斤300</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">暗時無月　路燈跤</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Thái-ko蛾仔leh唱kha-lá-óo-khe</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Mài吵--lah！恬恬睏</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">烏色ê靴管忝--ah</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">一跤徛直直　一跤睏笑笑</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kônn——koh落眠</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhqdj1vGFMLJF_36-YzXxI2Pim6VPKsmSl4GGC7dePkhJGZmA7Y6U2BGuDShDsMJITQPJzVk7oC5WLLMPH23mkt7K_6f-rJeSo_-wst2loCu5DaZ0GLYhsh63zUnGehcf7uTqXqp7Si163D_z6Ui9g8sRvLYtqU2GnSTHThuurWzJZ3BvJB6tcu5npJM97n/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1376%E6%9C%9F_5.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhqdj1vGFMLJF_36-YzXxI2Pim6VPKsmSl4GGC7dePkhJGZmA7Y6U2BGuDShDsMJITQPJzVk7oC5WLLMPH23mkt7K_6f-rJeSo_-wst2loCu5DaZ0GLYhsh63zUnGehcf7uTqXqp7Si163D_z6Ui9g8sRvLYtqU2GnSTHThuurWzJZ3BvJB6tcu5npJM97n/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1376%E6%9C%9F_5.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><br /></div></div></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg7wYqJ3hKj9yoFEzEAEugY-7M2Q7N2SvlVSszSwFECdJVoM5L11lyKk0pgb9eN01ESC74hQ0xqJDasBkQolFCC9L9Ri9erAZ7soU5atzAVBFPGqEw7CAIhOVkytrsw7zpNIUKPBjZDSTlIXupeCX99nkF-D9UxlezWrP6giWVZijog0aLgyY67tLgzo-Tu/s640/376%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"640\" data-original-width=\"449\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg7wYqJ3hKj9yoFEzEAEugY-7M2Q7N2SvlVSszSwFECdJVoM5L11lyKk0pgb9eN01ESC74hQ0xqJDasBkQolFCC9L9Ri9erAZ7soU5atzAVBFPGqEw7CAIhOVkytrsw7zpNIUKPBjZDSTlIXupeCX99nkF-D9UxlezWrP6